#===----------------------------------------------------------------------===#
# VALUs before the lead do not add up with matrix ops after it: 15 VALUs then 6 matrix ops after an
# XDL producer wait (pure 6 < 12; the mixed lead of 5 leaves one slot of 7; the no-order rule has 15
# of 21). Reading the result waits for the 6 matrix ops behind the producer in its pipe.
#===----------------------------------------------------------------------===#
# CHECK-LABEL: @vdst_valu_only_15v_then_6w_waits
# CHECK: s_wait_alu
# CHECK-SAME: va_vdst = 6
# CHECK-NEXT: ds_store_b32
st.func @vdst_valu_only_15v_then_6w_waits() {
^entry:
